# sha256 of the uv 0.13.9 release tarballs up.sh may ship to a server, one
# "<sha256>  <file name>" line each, as sha256sum prints them.
#
# PLACEHOLDER: fill these in before the first deploy, and up.sh refuses until
# then. Copy each line from the release's .sha256 asset, e.g.
#   https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/download/0.13.9/uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256
#   https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/download/0.13.9/uv-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256
# then delete this paragraph.
PLACEHOLDER  uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
PLACEHOLDER  uv-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
